[I] A library for rendering SVG and Mathml, implementing a DOM like API

[T] Lasem is a C/GObject based SVG and MathML renderer using cairo and
[T] pango, supporting output formats such as PNG, SVG, PDF and PostScript.
[T] Its API tries to follow the SVG and MathML DOM, and it includes the
[T] lasem-render tool.

[U] https://lasemproject.github.io/lasem/

[A] Lasem Authors
